body:
@Alex2782 Setting this to `true` turns on legacy packaging, which while it makes the apk smaller, it increases install size because a copy of the libraries is now required by the system.

See https://developer.android.com/build/releases/past-releases/agp-3-6-0-release-notes#extractNativeLibs and https://stackoverflow.com/a/44704840 for more details.

I'll take a look at the templates not installing properly.

